---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Tagline from "../components/Tagline.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About IRS"
  description="About Illini Rhythm Syndicate (IRS), the rhythm game RSO at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign."
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5 py-14 sm:gap-6 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 max-w-4xl"
  >
    <Tagline text="ABOUT US" />
    <h1
      class="font-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl lg:text-6xl 2xl:text-7xl"
    >
      IRS: Rhythm Games @ UIUC
    </h1>
    <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl">
      Illini Rhythm Syndicate (IRS) is a registered student organization at the
      University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign that serves the arcade and mobile
      rhythm gaming community. Our club has two main missions:
    </p>
    <ol
      class="font-body list-decimal space-y-1 pl-6 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl"
    >
      <li>
        To foster a vibrant and welcoming environment for new and experienced
        rhythm game players alike.
      </li>
      <li>
        To provide access to arcade rhythm games that are not readily available
        in campustown or the greater North America region.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl">
      Originally founded in late 2023 as a branch of <a
        href="https://ddrillini.club/"
        target="_blank"
        class="font-semibold text-irs-navy underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-irs-cyan-deep"
        >DDRIllini</a
      >, our community has since grown to become an independent RSO with over
      500 Discord members, hosting regular freeplays, tournaments, and arcade
      trips. Outside of recreational events, we also organize multiple
      engineering projects a semester, where students of all backgrounds can
      learn hands-on engineering skills such as computer-aided design,
      electronics, and programming through designing and building arcade rhythm
      game cabinets. Our controllers have been featured at various campus-wide
      events, such as <a
        href="https://www.ui-con.org/"
        target="_blank"
        class="font-semibold text-irs-navy underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-irs-cyan-deep"
        ><i>UI-CON</i></a
      >, Champaign-Urbana's Anime Convention, and <i>Rumble in the Prairie</i>,
      an annual dance game tournament hosted by DDRIllini.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
